<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pauxillŭlus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pausill-</span></b> ), a, um,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj. dim.</i>
			[pauxillus], <i>very little</i>, <i>very
				small</i> (anteand post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in libello hoc obsignato ad te attuli
					pauxillulo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 2, 4, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lembus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Merc. 1, 2, 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pisces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rud. 4, 3, 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Stich. 1, 3, 115</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fames,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 3, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rud. 3, 4, 24</span></i>
			 Fleck. (al. pauxillulum): admonitiones, Gell. N. A. praef.
				<i>med.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pauxil-lŭlum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pausill-</span></b> ), n., <i>a
				little</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de tuis deliciis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Truc. 5, 48</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reliquom pauxillulum nummorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Phorm. 1, 1, 3</span></i>
			.—Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pauxillŭlum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pausill-</span></b> ), <i>a
				little</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hanc forem pausillulum aperi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 4, 7, 35</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2,
			9</span></i>.</div>
